---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Contact" description="Contact Talha M Blog: send feedback, corrections and suggestions by email.">
  <section class="article-head"><h1>Contact</h1></section>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>The fastest way to reach Talha M Blog is by email:</p>
    <p><a href="mailto:lartkapagal@gmail.com"><b>lartkapagal@gmail.com</b></a></p>

    <h2>What you can write to us about</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><b>Corrections:</b> If you find a mistake in any article, tell us which article and what is wrong. We will check it and fix it, and mark the article as updated.</li>
      <li><b>Feedback:</b> Tell us what you liked, or what was hard to understand.</li>
      <li><b>Suggestions:</b> You can suggest a topic you want explained in simple English.</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      <a href="mailto:lartkapagal@gmail.com?subject=Message%20for%20Talha%20M%20Blog">Tap here to write an email</a>
    </p>

    <p>We read every email, but it can take some time to reply. Thank you for your patience.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
